  "instruction": "The quarterly ledger restore rehearsal is supposed to happen this week and Matteo asked for Thursday. It is a long continuous run with evidence capture, so I need to know whether Thursday genuinely fits on a runner with the isolated VLAN without displacing the compliance batch, and if it does not, the earliest day that does. Confirm the snapshot segments are actually restorable too. Book the pending reservation where it truly fits, and leave a note for Matteo with the date, what constrained it, and what the alternatives would have cost or required.",
